    {
      "id": "comparison-note",
      "widgetType": "markdown",
      "config": {
        "text": "### Born in 1929\n\n**Anne Frank** (1929–1945) and **Martin Luther King Jr.** (1929–1968) were both born in 1929. Their lives, though, ran very differently — hers ended at 15, his at 39.\n\nThe timeline below puts every dated event Wikidata records for both of them on **one axis**, so the shared years line up. The cards around it are the same two subjects as prose, images and traffic — the two halves of a life: what is recorded as data, and what is written and shown.\n\nℹ The timeline's ⚙ has an **align** setting: *calendar years*, or *age* (each life anchored at birth). See [LIFELINE-WIDGET](https://github.com/fuzheado/wikibento/blob/main/docs/LIFELINE-WIDGET.md).",
        "allowExternalImages": false,
        "refreshSeconds": 86400
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "lives-timeline",
      "widgetType": "sparql",
      "config": {
        "preset": "two-lives",
        "query": "SELECT ?who ?whoLabel ?date ?kind ?what ?whatLabel WHERE {\n  VALUES ?who { wd:Q4583 wd:Q8027 }\n  ?who wdt:P570 ?died .\n  { ?who wdt:P569 ?date . BIND(\"born\" AS ?kind) } UNION\n  { ?who wdt:P570 ?date . BIND(\"died\" AS ?kind) } UNION\n  { ?who p:P69  ?st . ?st ps:P69  ?what ; pq:P580 ?date . BIND(\"studied at\" AS ?kind) } UNION\n  { ?who p:P108 ?st . ?st ps:P108 ?what ; pq:P580 ?date . BIND(\"worked at\" AS ?kind) } UNION\n  { ?who p:P39  ?st . ?st ps:P39  ?what ; pq:P580 ?date . BIND(\"held office\" AS ?kind) } UNION\n  { ?who p:P166 ?st . ?st ps:P166 ?what ; pq:P585 ?date . BIND(\"awarded\" AS ?kind) } UNION\n  { ?who p:P26  ?st . ?st ps:P26  ?what ; pq:P580 ?date . BIND(\"married\" AS ?kind) } UNION\n  { ?who p:P551 ?st . ?st ps:P551 ?what ; pq:P580 ?date . BIND(\"lived in\" AS ?kind) }\n  FILTER(?date <= ?died)\n  SERVICE wikibase:label { bd:serviceParam wikibase:language \"en,mul\". }\n}\nORDER BY ?who ?date",
        "endpoint": "wdqs",
        "renderer": "timeline",
        "maxRows": 100,
        "align": "calendar",
        "title": "Two lives on one axis",
        "showOverlap": true,
        "cardTheme": "dark",
        "refreshSeconds": 1800
      }
    },
